## 转换器

Converter 负责请求体和响应体的序列化与反序列化。推荐使用 Kotlin Serialization。

```kotlin
@Module
@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)
object NetworkModule {

    @Provides
    @Singleton
    fun provideJson(): Json = Json {
        ignoreUnknownKeys = true
        coerceInputValues = true
        encodeDefaults = true
        isLenient = true
    }

    @Provides
    @Singleton
    fun provideRetrofit(
        okHttpClient: OkHttpClient,
        json: Json
    ): Retrofit {
        return Retrofit.Builder()
            .baseUrl("https://api.example.com/v1/")
            .client(okHttpClient)
            .addConverterFactory(json.asConverterFactory("application/json".toMediaType()))
            .build()
    }
}
```

| 转换器               | 依赖                                        | 特点                 |
| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | -------------------- |
| Kotlin Serialization | `retrofit2-kotlinx-serialization-converter` | 编译时生成，性能好   |
| Moshi                | `converter-moshi`                           | 轻量，Kotlin 友好    |
| Gson                 | `converter-gson`                            | 历史最广泛，反射开销 |

